{{Faction | faction = Ragers | image1 = | caption-image1 = | nickname = | philosophy = Life is a test. Find out where you stand. | founded = | factol = | sigilhq = | homefield = [[Ysgard]] | allies = [[Fated]], [[Doomguard]], [[Xaositects]] | enemies = [[Fraternity of Order]], [[Harmonium]], [[Mercykillers]] | predecessor = | successor = }}
The '''Ragers''' are a [[sect]] who believe that they need to find out where you stand in the cosmic pecking order, and the way to do that is by picking fights.
== History ==
== Philosophy ==
The Ragers treat life like a big tournament: If you can defeat someone, you're above them on the ladder. If they can defeat you, they're above you. The only way to figure out where you stand is by confronting and fighting nearly everyone.
== Role ==
== Membership == : ''See also:'' [[List of Ragers members]]
== Background Information == * The Ragers are similar in behavior to the [[Dispossessed]], although their philosophies differ.
== References == * {{b|Planescape|Planescape Monstrous Compendium Appendix II|page=76-77}}
